# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Requires organization **Agent secrets: write** permission and access to the selected repository. The existing secret must have `visibility = "selected"`.

This resource manages only one association. Destroying it revokes that repository's access without deleting the secret or modifying other associations. Do not combine it with `github_agents_organization_secret_repositories` for the same secret.

